  "bottomContent": "<div id=\"seo-intro\" style=\"padding:8px 0 0;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,46px);letter-spacing:3px;line-height:1.1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin:16px 0 10px;\">Corporate Bingo Online</h1>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\"><strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Corporate Bingo</strong> is the perfect game for boring work meetings — now playable online for 2-50 players, for free, no signup required.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\">Each player gets a unique 5×5 card filled with corporate buzzwords. When you hear a phrase in the meeting — mark it off! First player to complete a line wins. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">2-50 players</strong>.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Perfect for <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">team meetings and video calls</strong>. Makes even the most tedious meeting entertaining. Works on any device — just share the link with your team.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🎯 2-50 players</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">👶 Ages 16+</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🆓 Free to play</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">📱 Mobile friendly</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">💼 For meetings</span></div>\n  </div>\n<script>\n  (function() {\n    // SEO intro sits below the game — no injection needed, stays in natural position\n    var intro = document.getElementById('seo-intro');\n    if (intro) intro.style.display = 'block';\n  })();\n</script>\n<div style=\"max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:16px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">How to Play Corporate Bingo Online</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">The host creates a room and shares the code. Each player gets a unique card with corporate phrases. During the meeting when someone uses a buzzword — click it on your card. Complete a horizontal, vertical or diagonal line and shout BINGO!</p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">Who Is This Game For?</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Corporate Bingo is perfect for anyone who sits through work meetings. It makes meetings less monotonous and creates shared jokes within the team. Great for remote teams on video calls.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <a href=\"/korporacyjne-bingo\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇵🇱 Korporacyjne Bingo</a><a href=\"/unternehmens-bingo\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇩🇪 Unternehmens